{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43632","headline":"重联句一首 · 清昼","name":"重联句一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相将惜别且迟迟，未到新丰欲醉时。\n去郡独携程氏酒，入朝可忘习家池。\n仍怜故吏依依恋，自有清光处处随。\n晚景南徐何处宿，秋风北固不堪辞。\n吴中诗酒饶佳兴，秦地关山引梦思。\n对酒已伤嘶马去，衔恩只待扫门期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}